h":"GPON Downstream Speed: Up to 2.488 Gbps per PON port","c":[]},{"h":"GPON Upstream Speed: Up to 1.244 Gbps per PON port","c":[]},{"h":"Supports FTTH, FTTB, FTTO, and ISP broadband deployments","c":[]},{"h":"Standard 1U rack-mount design","c":[]},{"h":"OMCI-based ONU auto-discovery and remote management","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 01 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>The KingType GPT-C828V 8-Port GPON OLT is a carrier-grade Optical Line Terminal (OLT) designed for high-capacity FTTH (Fiber to the Home), FTTB (Fiber to the Building), FTTO, and enterprise fiber access networks. Built for Internet Service Providers (ISPs), telecom operators, and large-scale fiber deployments, this OLT delivers reliable GPON connectivity, centralized management, and outstanding network scalability.</p><p><br></p><p>Featuring 8 GPON PON ports, the KingType GPT-C828V provides high-bandwidth optical transmission, enabling efficient delivery of broadband, voice, and IPTV services over a single fiber infrastructure. With advanced Layer 2 networking capabilities and OMCI-based ONU management, it simplifies deployment, monitoring, and maintenance while ensuring stable network performance.</p><p><br></p><p>The GPT-C828V supports essential networking technologies including VLAN, QoS, ACL, IGMP Snooping, DHCP Relay, and multiple management interfaces such as Web GUI, CLI, SNMP, and Telnet. Its compact rack-mount design and carrier-grade architecture make it an ideal solution for expanding GPON access networks.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>8 GPON PON Ports</li><li>GPON Downstream Speed: Up to 2.488 Gbps per PON port</li><li>GPON Upstream Speed: Up to 1.244 Gbps per PON port</li><li>Supports FTTH, FTTB, FTTO, and ISP broadband deployments</li><li>OMCI-based ONU auto-discovery and remote management</li><li>Advanced Layer 2 switching features</li><li>Supports VLAN, QoS, ACL, DHCP Relay, and IGMP Snooping</li><li>Web GUI, CLI, SNMP, and Telnet management</li><li>Carrier-grade security and traffic management</li><li>High reliability with stable optical transmission</li><li>Standard 1U rack-mount design</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"VSOL V1600G1-B 8 Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600g1-b-8-port-gpon-olt","now":"125,000৳","old":"128,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600GS-F Single PON GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600gs-f-single-pon-gpon-olt","now":"33,000৳","old":"35,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600GT 2-Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600gt-2-port-gpon-olt","now":"54,000৳","old":"57,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600G2-B 16-Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600g2-b-16-port-gpon-olt","now":"226,000৳","old":"230,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600G0-B 4-Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600g0-b-4-port-gpon-olt","now":"87,000৳","old":"89,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM Scalable 8 port with 4 PON port E08GPS-2S+ GPON OLT","href":"/ecom-scalable-8-port-with-4-pon-port-e08gps-2s-gpon-olt","now":"68,000৳","old":"71,300৳","single":""},{"name":"HSGQ-G08L 8-Port GPON OLT","href":"/hsgq-g08l-8-port-gpon-olt","now":"105,000৳","old":"108,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HSGQ-G04L 4-Port GPON OLT","href":"/hsgq-g04l-4-port-gpon-olt","now":"71,000৳","old":"73,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM E01GP-S+ 1-PON Port GPON OLT","href":"/ecom-e01gp-s-1-pon-port-gpon-olt","now":"","old":"","single":"28,000৳"},{"name":"KingType GPT-C224V 4-Port GPON OLT","href":"/kingtype-gpt-c224v-4-port-gpon-olt","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/kingtype-gpna11-gpon-onu","image":{"src":"/image/cache/cata